{"parse": {"title": "虚无的倒影-05", "pageid": 106599, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%99%9A%E6%97%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%80%92%E5%BD%B1-04\" title=\"虚无的倒影-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">虚无的倒影-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%99%9A%E6%97%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%80%92%E5%BD%B1-06\" title=\"虚无的倒影-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">虚无的倒影</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AE.8C.E5.85.A8.E5.A4.B1.E8.B4.A5.E6.97.A5.E8.AE.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"完全失败日记\">完全失败日记</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 完全失败日记</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Confession of Failure</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_men2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_men2\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_men2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-2_8_at_men2.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_men2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-2_8_at_men2.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_men2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-2_8_at_men2.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_men2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_fangche.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_fangche\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_fangche\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-2_8_bg_fangche.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_fangche.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-2_8_bg_fangche.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_fangche.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-2_8_bg_fangche.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_fangche.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312015.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-312015.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312015.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312015.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-312015.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312015.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-312015.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312015.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>这是最后了吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她好像只剩意识，如果那是她的意识，她依然紧紧怀抱着一颗吊坠。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_men2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_men2\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_men2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-2_8_at_men2.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_men2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-2_8_at_men2.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_men2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-2_8_at_men2.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_men2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>诺谛卡，你从哪里开始错了呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>你的探险一无所获。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>你为了生存，吃了自己的小鹿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>你不仅没有听祖父的话，还让你的朋友全部送了死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>哈哈……诺谛卡……你要去哪里呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她几乎与那些被消解后的淤泥融为一体，她承认了自己的罪过，但她的忏悔并非纯粹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:83%\">我不知道……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:83%\">我只是……我不会停留在这里……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:83%\">就算错了这么多……我也要去看看……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:83%\">我想去找到那个答案……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>直到我知晓答案之时，我都不会停下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对于消解灵魂的胃袋来说，这种精神是一种难解的异物，于是只好任其虚弱地徘徊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我今天还没有……没有写日记呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>如果不是每天都记录的话，就没有意义了呀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>微弱的意识在黑暗之中茫然地逡巡，寻找一本已经抵达坏结局的日记本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>在……在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我的日记本……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她听到一阵细微的响声，窸窸窣窣，在胃袋的蠕动之中难以被分辨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-312011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-312011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-312011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>啊，在这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一本厚厚的日记本陷在黑色的淤泥之中，它饱经风霜，忠诚地见证了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>咦……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她匍匐着爬向和自己一样被黑暗吞噬的日记本，但它竟然兀自燃烧起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-312012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-312012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-312012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>不……不……我的日记……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>诺谛卡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>可是诺谛卡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你拥有的日记本，就是真实的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-312012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-312012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-312012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？ ：</div><div>你总是在上面写写画画，涂抹修改，你的日记记录了你每一天的生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？ ：</div><div>即便是你，也会被一本写满失败的日记欺骗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？ ：</div><div>你应该有所察觉的……你所拥有的真实不该是如此。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-634010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-634010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-634010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">村民Ⅰ：</div><div>天啊！诺谛卡！真是好样的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">村民Ⅱ：</div><div>小诺谛卡，祝福你，我的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>低下头，花环绕过眼睛，戴到最勇敢的人胸前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚奖章，带有手工编织的绳结，还有充满热情的欢呼和掌声，为一个初次参加赛鹿节就摘得桂冠的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-527501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-527501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-527501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-527501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-527501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-527501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我、我是第一名？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗夫：</div><div>是的，孩子，没有人比你更快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗夫：</div><div>我为你感到骄傲，诺谛卡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-527501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-527501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-527501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>祖父……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312026.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312026.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我得了第一呀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅰ：</div><div>当然，诺谛卡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅰ：</div><div>这不是唯一一次，你想起来了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>所以我没有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅱ：</div><div>那种可怕的事情从未发生……它很健康，你们一起参加了四年的赛鹿节。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_xuedi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_xuedi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_xuedi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_7_bg_xuedi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_xuedi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_7_bg_xuedi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_xuedi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_7_bg_xuedi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_xuedi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-634010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-634010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-634010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">村民Ⅰ：</div><div>又是诺谛卡！她又是第一！她简直是个驯鹿高手！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">村民Ⅱ：</div><div>诺谛卡，你真的太了不起了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>那我的祖父呢？还有我的朋友，我们一起去了南极……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅰ：</div><div>诺谛卡，你怎么会不理解你的朋友呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅱ：</div><div>是呀诺谛卡，你们如此……志同道合。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwumenwai_ye\"><img alt=\"muwumenwai_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/600px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/900px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/1200px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>弗里莱，祖父他……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>他完全失去神智了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在漫长的时间里，这位曾经睿智、无畏的科考领队，从精神的狂乱，走向沉默的覆灭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我……我想去南极。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>祖父说过，地母会保佑我们走在正确的道路上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>如果我不走向尽头，我也无法验证……什么才是正确的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>再见了……弗里莱，请你们等我回来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗里莱：</div><div>为什么这么说，诺谛卡？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>弗里莱，请你相信我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥兹：</div><div>诺谛卡，我们不是不相信你，而是你想要一个人去南极，却没想过——我们可以一起去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-525001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-525001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-525001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯特：</div><div>罗夫叔叔完成了一项壮举！我们应该一起走完他开拓的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>你们……你们都相信祖父？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗里莱：</div><div>从没有人怀疑过他的伟大，诺谛卡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥兹：</div><div>我们不会只在这里等待，等你一个人带回所有的真相和意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗里莱：</div><div>诺谛卡，我们要和你一起去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>真、真的吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我太高兴了，弗里莱，奥兹，考特……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们拥抱在一起，就像小时候第一次探险出发前那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——即使他们都很清楚，这是一次和以往都要不同的旅程。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "虚无的倒影-05"}}